The '''Davezra Way''' was a [[hyperspace route]]. After [[Incident on Quintil|escaping]] the [[Zualjinn Syndicate]] on [[Quintil]], a group of [[Spice Runners of Kijimi]] in the [[freighter]] ''[[Ragged Claw]]'', [[pilot]]ed by [[Poe Dameron]], evaded Zualjinn [[starship]]s by [[hyperspace skipping]]. One such jump took them to a location along the Davezra Way, where they encountered a massive [[garsath]].<ref name="Free Fall" />

